-- S720E lane 2's cheap piles at East Los Angeles (named gaps 3). Each row's checks become the
-- college load's image of its committed record (load_rows): checks.gaps and checks.confidence added; the
-- record unchanged. Receipt: kb/receipts/program_requirement_records_piles_s720_ela_2026-11-24_s720e.json (before_image per row).
-- Guarded UPDATE: only where the row holds the filed run, the before-image's record and checks,
-- and no person's check. It aborts, writing nothing, unless it matches the plan's 3 rows less
-- those a person checked (listed as skipped_checked), or a row holds a matching confirm.
